{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/44344","id":4724662914,"node_id":"PR_kwDOKALCgc8AAAABGZyigg","html_url":"https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/pull/44344","diff_url":"https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/pull/44344.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/pull/44344.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/issues/44344","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/44344/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/44344/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/issues/44344/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/statuses/519066abe8cf40f537a30dbfbc291bb00eaadf04","number":44344,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"revert(responses): revert \"fix(responses): keep gpt-5.4/5.5 tool calls on chat and merge bridged tool calls into one choice\" (#44295)","user":{"login":"devin-ai-integration[bot]","id":158243242,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCW6Zqg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/811515?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/devin-ai-integration","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## TLDR\n\nProblem this solves:\n\n- #44295 keeps gpt-5.4/5.5 function tool calls on chat when `reasoning_effort` is unset\n- That check only sees the top-level param, so an effort sent another way still reaches OpenAI\n- `extra_body: {reasoning_effort: low}` on gpt-5.4/5.5 plus a function tool now returns 400 on every call\n\nHow it solves it:\n\n- Reverts #44295 as a whole, so gpt-5.4+ function tool calls go to Responses again no matter where the effort comes from\n- The single-choice tool call merge from #44295 comes back on its own in a follow-up PR\n\nIntentional product change: gpt-5.4 and gpt-5.5 function tool calls without a top-level `reasoning_effort` go to `/responses` again, as they did from v1.97.0 until #44295. Until the follow-up lands, a bridged reply with text plus a tool call is split across two choices again\n\n## User Flow\n\nBefore: a team whose gpt-5.5 deployment sets the effort in `extra_body` gets a 400 on every tool call\n\n1. The proxy admin configures a `gpt-5.5` deployment with `litellm_params.extra_body: {reasoning_effort: low}`\n2. A developer sends POST https://litellm-domain/v1/chat/completions with one function tool\n3. The proxy answers 400: \"Function tools with reasoning_effort are not supported for gpt-5.5 in /v1/chat/completions\"\n\nAfter: the same request comes back with the tool call\n\n1. Same deployment\n2. The developer sends the same POST https://litellm-domain/v1/chat/completions\n3. The proxy answers 200 with `finish_reason: \"tool_calls\"`\n\n## Affected release\n\nNot in a release yet. The 400 comes from #44295, which merged to main on 2026-10-03\n\n## Pre-Submission checklist\n\n**Please complete all items before asking a LiteLLM maintainer to review your PR**\n\n- [ ] I have added meaningful tests\n- [x] The handful of test files covering my change pass locally, e.g. `uv run pytest tests/unit/<your_test_file>.py -v`. Leave the suites (`make test-unit-*`, `make test-unit`) to CI: it finishes in ~15 minutes where a laptop takes an hour or more\n- [ ] My PR passes all required CI/CD checks (e.g., lint, schema.d.ts sync check, etc.)\n- [x] My PR's scope is as isolated as possible; it only solves 1 specific problem\n- [ ] I have received a Greptile **Confidence Score of at least 4/5** before requesting a maintainer review (Greptile reviews automatically once the PR is opened; only comment `@greptileai` to re-request a review after pushing changes)\n\n## Screenshots / Proof of Fix\n\nReal OpenAI calls through the SDK, with gpt-5.5 and gpt-5.4, one function tool `get_weather`, and `extra_body={\"reasoning_effort\": \"low\"}`\n\n```python\nlitellm.completion(model=m, messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Weather in Paris? use the tool\"}], tools=tools, extra_body={\"reasoning_effort\": \"low\"})\n```\n\n### Before (a76ba8c01e)\n\n1. `openai/gpt-5.5` returns `BadRequestError: OpenAIException - Function tools with reasoning_effort are not supported for gpt-5.5 in /v1/chat/completions. To use function tools, use /v1/responses or set reasoning_effort to 'none'.`\n2. `openai/gpt-5.4` returns the same 400 for gpt-5.4\n\n### After (519066abe8)\n\n1. `openai/gpt-5.5` returns OK with `finish_reason: tool_calls`\n2. `openai/gpt-5.4` returns OK with `finish_reason: tool_calls`\n\n## Type\n\n🐛 Bug Fix\n\n## Caveats (if any)\n\n### Medium\n\n- Bridged replies with text plus a tool call split into two choices until the follow-up merges\n\nLink to Devin session: https://app.devin.ai/sessions/0395406d8f4a46ea899e96ae0a9f3d28\nOpen in Devin Desktop: https://app.devin.ai/desktop/session/0395406d8f4a46ea899e96ae0a9f3d28?variant=devin\nRequested by: @kerry-berri","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-03T06:38:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T06:53:52Z","closed_at":"2026-10-03T06:47:12Z","merged_at":"2026-10-03T06:47:12Z","merge_commit_sha":"d96e56c76ffd25d3d579a4fe519ed8c5e956691f","assignee":{"login":"kerry-berri","id":326648561,"node_id":"U_kgDOE3hC8Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/326648561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri","html_url":"https://github.com/kerry-berri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"kerry-berri","id":326648561,"node_id":"U_kgDOE3hC8Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/326648561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri","html_url":"https://github.com/kerry-berri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kerry-berri/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/user